# Copy for local development: cp .env.example .env
# In production the same variables are set in the Cloudflare Workers Builds *build*
# environment, not as runtime worker secrets: Vite inlines VITE_* at build time, so a
# runtime secret would never reach the bundle.
# Used from block 8 ("Cloud") onward. Left empty the app still works completely — it
# simply never syncs (invariant 39).

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# The Worker (workers/, block 9) needs its own SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_ANON_KEY as
# *runtime* variables — `wrangler secret put`, not this file. A build variable never
# reaches the runtime, and these two are not interchangeable. See workers/README.md.
